      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'You have the accounts of three witnesses. The crime was committed at 
    4 p.m. in Noob Park. Assume that everyone is telling the truth. Who committed
    the crime?

    Suspect 1:  At 3 p.m., I was going shopping at Qwerty Mall. I
    didn''y finish until 5 p.m. and I didn''t see anything suspicious.

    Suspect
    2: At 4 p.m., I was taking a stroll through the park.

    Suspect 3: DUDE!!!!!
    WHY DO YOU SUSPECT ME?!! I SWEAR I DIDN''T DO IT!!!!!!!!!!

    Suspect 4: Fine!
    I''ll tell you, but I expect you to exonerate me immediately as I am of (obviously)
    royal descent. At 4 p.m., I was exiting Noob Park. I didn''t see anyone. Now
    get out of my face!!!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
